FANTASY PIXEL RPG — OWLBEAR RODEO EXTENSION

This is the first standalone Owlbear Rodeo extension package.
The original character sheet is kept as index.html so its existing UI and RPG systems remain intact.

Files:
- manifest.json  Owlbear extension manifest
- index.html     Original Fantasy Pixel RPG Character Sheet
- icon.svg       Extension icon

INSTALL
1. Host this folder on a public HTTPS web host.
2. In Owlbear Rodeo, add the extension using the URL of manifest.json.
3. Enable the extension for the room.
4. Click Character Sheet in the Owlbear extension area.

This version is a UI-first integration. It does not yet synchronize character data with Owlbear tokens/scenes.
